                <div style="font-size: 1.2rem; font-weight: 800; color: var(--accent-primary); margin-bottom: 12px; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;">
                    🎯 مخرجات التعلم الوزارية (Learning Outcomes - Lessons 4 &amp; 5: Beyond the White Coat &amp; My Blog Post):
                </div>
                <div class="cards-grid grid-cards" style="margin-top: 10px;">
                    <div class="card" style="padding: 14px; background: rgba(11, 15, 25, 0.6); border: 1px solid rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.3);">
                        <strong style="color: var(--accent-secondary);">📖 Reading (Beyond the White Coat):</strong> Read a dramatic narrative about emergency room teamwork, car crash rescue, toddler foreign object removal, and compassionate patient care.
                    </div>
