                        <span class="tag-badge">يمسك بقوة</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="card-body">
                        <div class="simple-explain-box">
                            📖 <strong>Definition:</strong> to hold something tightly and suddenly, especially because you are afraid, hurt, or in pain.
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="card">
                    <div class="card-header">
                        <div class="word-en" style="color: var(--accent-primary);">forehead (n)</div>
                        <span class="tag-badge">جبهة / جبين</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="card-body">
                        <div class="simple-explain-box">
                            📖 <strong>Definition:</strong> the part of your face above your eyes and below your hair.
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="card">
                    <div class="card-header">
                        <div class="word-en" style="color: var(--accent-primary);">groan(ed) (v)</div>
                        <span class="tag-badge">يتأوه</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="card-body">
                        <div class="simple-explain-box">
                            📖 <strong>Definition:</strong> to make a deep long sound showing pain, unhappiness, or annoyance.
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="card">
                    <div class="card-header">
                        <div class="word-en" style="color: var(--accent-primary);">moan(ed) (v)</div>
                        <span class="tag-badge">يئن</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="card-body">
                        <div class="simple-explain-box">
                            📖 <strong>Definition:</strong> to make a low sound expressing pain or sadness.
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="card">
                    <div class="card-header">
                        <div class="word-en" style="color: var(--accent-primary);">scope (n)</div>
                        <span class="tag-badge">منظار طبي</span>
                    </div>
