            <!-- Derivatives -->
            <div class="section-title">🧬 3. المشتقات (Derivatives - صفحة 62)</div>
            <p class="section-hint">الفرق الدقيق بين الفعل والاسم مع الجمل التطبيقية موضع الامتحان:</p>
            <div class="cards-grid grid-cards" style="margin-bottom: 35px;">
                
                <div class="card">
                    <div class="card-header">
                        <div class="word-en">clutch</div>
                        <span class="tag-badge">عائلة المشتق</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="card-body">
                        <div style="margin-bottom: 8px;">
                            <strong style="color: var(--accent-primary);">clutch (v) [يمسك بقوة]:</strong><br>
                            <em>“He <strong style="color: var(--accent-primary);">clutched</strong> the rope tightly, so he did not fall.”</em>
                        </div>
                        <div>
                            <strong style="color: var(--accent-green);">clutch (n) [قبضة]:</strong><br>
                            <em>“His strong <strong style="color: var(--accent-green);">clutch</strong> at the rope stopped him from falling.”</em>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="card">
                    <div class="card-header">
                        <div class="word-en">groan</div>
                        <span class="tag-badge">عائلة المشتق</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="card-body">
                        <div style="margin-bottom: 8px;">
                            <strong style="color: var(--accent-primary);">groan (v) [يتأوه دهشة/ألماً]:</strong><br>
                            <em>“The fans <strong style="color: var(--accent-primary);">groaned</strong> when the ball missed the goal.”</em>
                        </div>
                        <div>
                            <strong style="color: var(--accent-green);">groan (n) [تأوه / صوت انزعاج]:</strong><br>
                            <em>“There was a <strong style="color: var(--accent-green);">groan</strong> from the fans when the ball missed the goal.”</em>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="card">
                    <div class="card-header">
                        <div class="word-en">moan</div>
                        <span class="tag-badge">عائلة المشتق</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="card-body">
                        <div style="margin-bottom: 8px;">
                            <strong style="color: var(--accent-primary);">moan (v) [يئن حزناً/ألماً]:</strong><br>
                            <em>“The patient <strong style="color: var(--accent-primary);">moaned</strong> all night because of the pain in her chest.”</em>
                        </div>
                        <div>
                            <strong style="color: var(--accent-green);">moan (n) [أنين]:</strong><br>
                            <em>“The <strong style="color: var(--accent-green);">moan</strong> of the patient made us feel sorry for him.”</em>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="card">
                    <div class="card-header">
                        <div class="word-en">stitch</div>
                        <span class="tag-badge">عائلة المشتق</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="card-body">
                        <div style="margin-bottom: 8px;">
                            <strong style="color: var(--accent-primary);">stitch (v) [يخيط جرحاً]:</strong><br>
                            <em>“The surgeon <strong style="color: var(--accent-primary);">stitched</strong> the wound.”</em>
                        </div>
                        <div>
                            <strong style="color: var(--accent-green);">stitch (n) [غرزة خياطة طبية]:</strong><br>
                            <em>“The wound needed three <strong style="color: var(--accent-green);">stitches</strong>.”</em>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

